&#x201C;Harry Potter&#x201D; is out the window. &#x201C;Harry Potter&#x201D; got me here, and I thank it for that. But I think we don't worry about it anymore.

I&#x2019;d rather do this. &#x201C;Harry Potter&#x201D; would have been a cool set to be on because it would have looked cool, but there would have been so many more people; I wouldn&#x2019;t have gotten to bond with everyone. I loved everyone on this set. I had such a good time filming it, and I think J.K. Rowling&#x2019;s a no anyway, but Jordan is a big yes.

