&#x201C;I do not see the unfinished as failure, or absence as a void to be filled, but as one of the most human and honest forms of life,&#x201D; Deniz says in a statement on the film&#x2019;s official website.

The Qatar-Morocco co-production, produced by Abdulrahim Al-Siddiqi and Bouchra Malek, is the sole fiction feature in the section.
